  "body": "Welcome to this beautifully proportioned 130sqm apartment, where generous living spaces, natural light and a wonderful connection to the outdoors come together to create an exceptionally comfortable home.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. Large sliding doors open onto the covered deck, where the beautiful morning sun creates the perfect spot for your morning coffee or simply enjoying the surrounding greenery.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is generously proportioned, with excellent natural light and a lovely outlook. It flows through to a well-appointed ensuite and a spacious walk-in wardrobe, providing plenty of storage and a wonderful sense of space.\r\n\r\nTwo further bedrooms offer excellent flexibility. Keep them as comfortable guest or family bedrooms, or make one your own home office, study or media room - whatever best suits the way you want to live. There is also a separate laundry with a large drying cupboard, along with a further bathroom for added convenience.\r\n\r\nBeing positioned on the lower level, this apartment offers the convenience of dual entry. Either from the street, a few easy steps lead directly onto the deck, which is nestled amongst established native garden, creating a wonderfully private and peaceful setting. Alternatively, you can enter via the main building entrance, which then opens directly into the living area.\r\n\r\nPracticality has also been carefully considered, with two dedicated car parks and electric-vehicle charging wiring in place for future use. A secure lock-up storage area provides ample space for additional belongings.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location. From here, it's a level and easy stroll to the Kensington Park café or continue to the beach and enjoy everything this wonderful setting has to offer. And, of course, if you have a four-legged companion, there are plenty of opportunities for a leisurely dog walk close to home.\r\n\r\nSpacious, private and surrounded by native gardens, this is a home that offers both comfort and convenience - all within the welcoming Kensington Park community.\r\n\r\nWe invite you to come and experience this generous home for yourself. Call Paul today or visit our onsite Sales Suite Tuesday to Sunday, 10am to 2pm.\r\nKensington Park Realty, Licensed REAA 2008.",
